    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "大星妈妈为什么不喜欢我？为什么？我现在不能和大星在一起。",
      "traditional": "大星媽媽為什麼不喜歡我？為什麼？我現在不能和大星在一起。",
      "pinyin": "dà xīng mā ma wèi shén me bù xǐ huan wǒ wèi shén me wǒ xiàn zài bù néng hé dà xīng zài yì qǐ",
      "english": "Why doesn’t Daxing’s mom like me? Why? Now I can’t be together with Daxing. "
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "为什么？！我太不高兴了！我的身体有点儿热，很热，太热了……",
      "traditional": "為什麼？！我太不高興了！我的身體有點兒熱，很熱，太熱了……",
      "pinyin": "wèi shén me wǒ tài bù gāo xìng le wǒ de shēn tǐ yǒu diǎn'r rè hěn rè tài rè le",
      "english": "Why?! I’m so unhappy! My body is a little hot, very hot, too hot …"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "“大星，你来，看看你的手机。”妈妈说。",
      "traditional": "“大星，你來，看看你的手機。”媽媽說。",
      "pinyin": "dà xīng nǐ lái kàn kan nǐ de shǒu jī mā ma shuō",
      "english": "“Daxing, come and look at your phone,” said Mom."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "“怎么了？”大星问。",
      "traditional": "“怎麼了？”大星問。",
      "pinyin": "zěn me le dà xīng wèn",
      "english": "“What’s the matter?” Daxing asked. "
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
