      "I’m Very Hot",
      "",
      "Why doesn’t Daxing’s mom like me? Why? Now I can’t be together with Daxing. ",
      "Why?! I’m so unhappy! My body is a little hot, very hot, too hot …",
      "",
      "“Daxing, come and look at your phone,” said Mom.",
      "",
      "“What’s the matter?” Daxing asked. ",
      "",
      "Mom said, “Your phone is very hot.”",
      "",
      "“Let me take a look,” Daxing said, “Is it too hot here?",
      "Never mind, it’s not hot over there. I’ll go over there with the Xiaomi phone.”",
      "",
      "Great, I’m back in Daxing’s hands! Now I know that when I’m very hot, Daxing will be together with me.",
